[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3308.87, "timestamp": "00:55:08", "text": "我運行了這個命令」一樣。  我想問個問題。你好，請繼續。  請隨時詢問 DTB 訊息運行情況。好的。呃，再加上這個東西。所以這意味著當我運行這個程式時，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3313.109, "timestamp": "00:55:13", "text": "它應該會發送聊天訊息，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3314.285, "timestamp": "00:55:14", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Are you aware of any known issues that might cause obs to crash upon launching vtube studio"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3317.829, "timestamp": "00:55:17", "text": "您是否知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3319.75, "timestamp": "00:55:19", "text": "啟動"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3321.99, "timestamp": "00:55:21", "text": "YouTube 工作室時可能會出現哪些顯而易見的問題？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3324.39, "timestamp": "00:55:24", "text": "哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3327.349, "timestamp": "00:55:27", "text": "現在我想問"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3331.75, "timestamp": "00:55:31", "text": "你的問題是，你的 Vive"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3336.069, "timestamp": "00:55:36", "text": "Studio 是否以任何方式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3340.23, "timestamp": "00:55:40", "text": "與 OBS 有連接"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3348.95, "timestamp": "00:55:48", "text": "？例如，你是否同時使用 OBS 和 YouTube Studio 等應用程式？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3352.309, "timestamp": "00:55:52", "text": "你有試過"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3355.91, "timestamp": "00:55:55", "text": "先啟動 VUB Studio，再啟動 OBS 嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3359.51, "timestamp": "00:55:59", "text": "當時就崩潰了嗎"}]